    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c1dd965b7ec0d258bb85687",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我在村里和美冬见面时，美冬告诉我，\n就在她几乎要放弃梦想时，是因为看到我\n奔跑的样子，才决心坚持下去的。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "865d221fa7b25a466505eca16858182f880c508f21944aa57138d8dd420e5a25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
