    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbcfbf9d59a24ca7829f026b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“没想到我边怀抱着烦恼边奔跑的模样……\n居然能够帮助到他人。这真的让我很高兴，\n所以……我也不会放弃的！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57e550c303921345298e76d65ec927e8a70e5987b460f891c92dd3a14da3079",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1029/storytimeline_501029404.json",
      "json_path": [
