      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“所以今年我要重新锻炼自己，新年过后去挑战\n‘大阪杯’！盛冈的超有毅力赛马娘，\n要拿出实力给大家看！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "7839c565f46d69ae0082cd83b6ec94f57b6a80200ce528177a9c9742e405bed4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
