      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我试着鼓起勇气问了城市，才知道……\n原来像她那么完美的人，还是会有烦恼。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e7f030f0670153111cc24482c0e8d2ca3489493acc7f4d166be0739d78a31ec",
