      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我告诉城市说，\n我就是有过想变得像她一样的梦想，\n才有办法咬紧牙关拼命努力。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "167968c64dad8a0b90ad4254ee57ac916cee5fb5e031abba12195a73d9bf4e3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
