      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“……我把想说的话告诉她了！\n我想城市一定能打起精神，再继续跑步的。\n而我也会加油！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "36175d8f28f2dc0ed2d321ac0bc318f4386284bc67fbdf723da77f6912f10177",
